    "motion_caption": "Dance style: contemporary\nAs one knee straightens, the dancer lowers the hand on that side to the right while the other reaches right and up, then folds back left as the lower arm rises and opens leftward. The folded hand drops farther left and reverses right while the other continues upward, then lengthens down-left as both hands sweep left and return right. Both arms extend downward before the first folds into a shared lift, carries its hand right, and descends with the other hand. The other hand moves left and rebounds upward before both lower again and sweep right. The first hand lifts as the opposite knee softens and its arm opens, then sinks with an extending elbow.",
